  "published": "2026-09-02T17:09:24.457Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0 — EvdevKeypadInput now raises KeyReleased (evdev key-up) and derived gestures KeyTapped, KeyDoubleTapped, KeyHeld (long-press), and KeyHolding (press-and-hold auto-repeat), configurable via new KeyGestureOptions; add the pure, host-testable KeyGestureDetector state machine. KeyPressed is unchanged. 0.4.0 — add SystemTelemetry (CPU/memory/SoC+board temp/uptime/load from /proc + thermal sysfs), MemInfo, TelemetrySnapshot, CpuSampler, ProcFs parsers, and DeviceInfo (hostname/os-release/operstate/IPv4) — a readable, framework-agnostic telemetry API (not a control). 0.3.0 — SoftKeyFooter Natural layout centres the d-pad; add SoftKeyLayoutMap.ToLogical (hardware→logical key remap). 0.2.0 — add SoftKeyFooter (Physical/Natural layout). 0.1.0 — EvdevKeypadInput (IInputBackend) + KeypadKey.",
